Error [E0957]: `find` glob must be a string literal
  --> tests/ui/comptime_find_nonliteral.jet:1:11
    |
  1 | @paths :: find("inputs/" + "*.jet")
    |           ^^^^
 Why: A computed glob can't be audited at build time, so the compiler can't tell which file it reads
 Fix: Pass the glob inline, e.g. `find("content/**/*.jet")`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0957
